---
import Eyebrow from '../Eyebrow.astro';
import SectionHeadline from '../SectionHeadline.astro';
import FeatureCard from '../FeatureCard.astro';
---

<section id="ai" class="py-20 md:py-24" aria-label="The AI Layer">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <Eyebrow text="03 &middot; THE AI LAYER" />
    <SectionHeadline>
      Eight engines.<br><em>All real.</em> All sport-aware.
    </SectionHeadline>

    <p class="text-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-14">
      Every AI feature runs live GPT-4o-mini calls with athlete-specific context &mdash;
      sport, position, grad year, stats, and recruiting history. Cached intelligently
      in Redis. At 1,000 MAU, total AI cost is under $20/month. These aren't marketing
      checkboxes. They're shipping features with real model calls behind them.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <FeatureCard
        emoji="🎯"
        title="Score Coach"
        description="3 daily AI action steps, benchmarked to your sport and position. Delivered via 7 AM push notification."
      />
      <FeatureCard
        emoji="📋"
        title="Scout Reports"
        description="Auto-generated narrative per athlete, included in recruiter alerts and coach dashboards."
      />
      <FeatureCard
        emoji="✉️"
        title="Recruiting Letters"
        description="Personalized outreach drafts with program picker, compliance guardrails, and tone analysis."
      />
      <FeatureCard
        emoji="🔍"
        title="Natural Language Search"
        description='Query athletes like a recruiter thinks: "6&apos;2 LB Illinois 2026 with a 3.5 GPA."'
      />
      <FeatureCard
        emoji="📊"
        title="Gap Analyzer"
        description="Benchmark against real peers in your sport, position, and class year. See percentile rank."
      />
      <FeatureCard
        emoji="🎬"
        title="AI Game Report"
        description="Post-game breakdown with play-by-play analysis, player awards, and sport-aware iconography."
      />
      <FeatureCard
        emoji="💰"
        title="Offer Comparison"
        description="Side-by-side financial aid analysis across scholarship percentage, institutional aid, and walk-on terms."
      />
      <FeatureCard
        emoji="📡"
        title="Offer Probability"
        description="Predict commit likelihood from 4 behavioral signals: profile views, saves, message frequency, and pipeline stage."
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
